  "title": "Aston Martin Valen Powers Into Pebble Beach",
  "summary": "Aston Martin’s Q Branch has let loose the world’s most powerful front-engined car: the Valen. The Valen makes its case for views and clicks at Car Week by boasting an 838-hp iteration of Aston’s own 5.3-liter twin-turbocharged V-12. There’s also 737 lb-ft of torque sent to the rear wheels via an eight-speed ZF automatic transmission […]",
